Idiom: if `prefix[j] - prefix[i] == K`, then the subarray `(i, j]` has sum `K`.

Notes: `count += freq[prefix - K];` before `freq[prefix]++;`. Otherwise, when `K == 0`, the current prefix could incorrectly match itself.

